# Input

```scss
.icon{
--icon:url(
data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg/%3E
);
--commented:url(
/*v1*/asset.svg
);
--interpolated:url(#{"asset\
-name.svg"});
--multiline:url(/icons/#{
"mark"
}.svg);
color:red;
}

```


# Options

```json
{
  "formatter": {
    "lineEnding": "crlf"
  }
}
```

# Formatted

